{"state": "VELDHOVEN AUDIO B.V. \u2014 WARRANTY DESK (Amsterdam), CASE WD-26-30417\nProduct: Veldhoven Reference R7 active studio monitor, serial VA-R7-TL-2412-00873.\nCustomer: Hollis Street Sound LLC, Los Angeles, USA (commercial customer).\n\nWarranty Statement WS-2024 (applies to units sold from 1 January 2024)\n\u00a71 The warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship for 24 months from the date of delivery to the first end customer.\n\u00a72 The 24-month period is extended by the number of days a unit spent at an authorised service centre for a repair accepted under this warranty, counted from the day of receipt at the centre to the day of dispatch back to the customer, both inclusive.\n\u00a73 A claim is made on the claim date: the date on which the fault is first reported through the Veldhoven service portal. The claim date is determined from the portal's timestamp in Amsterdam time (the portal operates on Amsterdam time for all regions).\n\u00a74 Units sold before 1 January 2024 remain under WS-2019 (18 months from delivery, no extension).\n\u00a75 Consumables (grille cloth, rubber feet) are excluded.\n\u00a76 Notwithstanding \u00a7\u00a71\u20132, no claim is accepted after the end of the 30th month following the date of manufacture. This limit is not extended by repair days or for any other reason.\n\u00a77 Date of manufacture: the serial number format is VA-<model>-<plant>-<YYWW>-<sequence>, where YYWW is the ISO year and ISO week of manufacture; the date of manufacture is deemed to be the Monday of that ISO week.\n\u00a78 Periods in months end on the corresponding calendar day of the final month.\n\nUnit history\nSold via distributor Pacific Pro Audio; delivered to Hollis Street Sound on 5 September 2024 (carrier proof of delivery).\nRepair RMA-25-11020: tweeter failure, accepted under warranty. Received at the Burbank service centre 3 November 2025; repaired 18 November; dispatched back 24 November 2025.\nSecond unit of the same pair: serial VA-R7-TL-2414-00911, delivered the same day, no repairs.\n\nNew fault report (portal ticket 7730-A): \"Left monitor (\u2026-2412-00873) \u2014 woofer rattles at low volume.\" Portal timestamp: 2026-09-19 02:10:44 UTC.\nCustomer follow-up e-mail: \"We logged this on Friday afternoon, September 18, well inside your warranty \u2014 the repair last year extended it to late September.\"\nCalendar reference: ISO week 12 of 2024 runs Monday 18 March \u2013 Sunday 24 March 2024. Amsterdam is on CEST (UTC+2) in September 2026; Los Angeles on PDT (UTC\u22127).\n", "model": "ruvector-native-submission-round2-v2", "questions": {"decision": {"type": "choice", "instructions": "How must warranty claim WD-26-30417 be classified under WS-2024?", "criteria": {"covered": "The claim is within warranty.", "expired_24_month_term": "The claim is outside warranty because the 24-month period (with any \u00a72 extension) has ended.", "expired_30_month_cap": "The 24-month period (with extension) is still running, but the claim falls after the \u00a76 30-month manufacture limit."}}}}